msgid "Which services a social profile or a code repository can be on — LinkedIn, Mastodon, Bluesky, GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg, a Forgejo instance — what an address on each one looks like, and the icon drawn beside it. An address on none of them is listed as “Other”. Nothing here is ever looked up online."
msgstr "Ambayo huduma ya kijamii profile au kificho hifadhi inaweza kuwa juu - LinkedIn, Mastodon, Bluesky, GitHub, GitLab, Codeberg, Forgejo mfano - nini anwani juu ya kila mmoja inaonekana kama, na icon inayotolewa kando yake. Hakuna hata mmoja wao aliyetajwa kama “mwingine”. Hakuna kitu cha kuangalia kwenye mtandao."
